00:03:20.960 --> 00:03:25.760
steals modern training tricks that&nbsp;
Transformers usually benefit from,&nbsp;

00:03:26.400 --> 00:03:31.040
to build the ultimate ConvNeXt architecture!

00:03:31.040 --> 00:03:38.480
This, ahm... ConvNeXt is super interesting&nbsp;
because by “modernizing” ConvNets step by step,&nbsp;&nbsp;

